<title>BELGIUM: EU keeps molasses import duties at zero.</title>
<headline>EU keeps molasses import duties at zero.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee set molasses import duties unchanged at zero on Wednesday a member state official said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for cane molasses was set at 8.26 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 8.32 Ecus the previous week and for beet at 12.13 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 12.17 Ecus, the official said on Thursday. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
